---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Refrigerant Leak Repair Gastonia NC | AC Freon Leak Fix | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="Certified refrigerant leak repair in Gastonia, NC. Locate, seal, and recharge to manufacturer spec. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services / Refrigerant Leak Repair</p>
      <h1>Refrigerant Leak Repair in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>Low refrigerant means warm air and rising bills. We locate the source, seal it correctly, and recharge to spec.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Low refrigerant means warm air and rising energy bills. Our certified technicians perform <strong>Refrigerant Leak Repair</strong> — locating the source, sealing it correctly, and recharging to manufacturer specification. Topping up without finding the leak is only a temporary fix.</p>
      <h2>Signs of a Refrigerant Leak</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>AC blowing warm or lukewarm air</li>
        <li>Ice forming on the indoor coil or refrigerant lines</li>
        <li>Hissing or bubbling sounds near the unit</li>
        <li>Sudden spike in Duke Energy bills</li>
        <li>System running longer without reaching set temperature</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We use electronic leak detectors, UV dye where appropriate, and pressure testing to find leaks in coils, line sets, and fittings. After repair, we evacuate, recharge to the exact charge listed on the nameplate, and verify performance.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Need refrigerant leak repair in Gastonia?</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
